      "hizbQuarter": 71,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1167,
      "text": "And [remember, O believers], when Allah promised you one of the two parties[4], that it would fall to you, and you wished that the unarmed one would fall to you. But it was Allah’s Will to establish the truth by His Words and exterminate the disbelievers,",
      "surah": {
